OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-terror blocks installed
OL,4,Aaround new square
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcrete security blocks have been
OL,7,Ftemporarily placed around a
OL,8,Fnewly-opened section of Leicester's
OL,9,Frevamped market square.
OL,11,FThe northern end of Market Place
OL,12,Freopened to the public for the first
OL,13,Ftime since 2023 last week as a #9.4m
OL,14,Ftransformation of the area nears
OL,15,Fcompletion.
OL,17,FPedestrians can now cross the area
OL,18,Fafter site fences were removed, but
OL,19,FLeicester City Council said the blocks
OL,20,Fhad been installed as an anti-terrorism
OL,21,Fmeasure to prevent vehicles from
OL,22,Fentering the square.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
